Tracker Cycles: the TidalCycles-style pattern engine and code editor
Copyright (C) 2026 CyopStudio and Tracker Cycles contributors

This licence covers the parts of Tracker Cycles written for it:

  tidal/                           the pattern engine, editor model, desktop
                                   prototype, tests and golden test data
  core/tidal/                      the firmware glue (player, editor,
                                   device voices, sample-folder loader,
                                   benches and test images)
  core/interface/tidalEditor/      the editor's screen on the Tracker
  core/AudioEngine/mtAudioTidal.cpp  the note entry point for Tidal events

Two files in those folders keep their own licences: tidal/editor/keyboard.h
reproduces the stock on-screen keyboard's layout tables (Polyend Tracker
CE's licence), and core/tidal/reverb_bench.* follows Polyverb's reverb
(MIT, as Polyverb).

Everything else in this repository comes from Polyend Tracker Community
Edition and stays under its own licence (the repository's top-level LICENSE,
"MIT License with Wholesale Commercial Clone Restriction"), including the
changes Tracker Cycles made inside Polyend Tracker CE's own files.

